325
00:12:07,650 --> 00:12:08,990
M'agrada molt aquesta imatge.

326
00:12:09,170 --> 00:12:11,910
Clar, aquesta estratègia no sap si fora plou

327
00:12:11,910 --> 00:12:14,090
