361
00:13:15,990 --> 00:13:19,070
I llavors el model ja pot respondre amb base a la realitat.

362
00:13:19,650 --> 00:13:21,410
Però, a veure, un moment, un moment.

363
00:13:21,750 --> 00:13:22,150
Digues.

364
00:13:22,150 --> 00:13:23,870
Si jo estic dissenyant un sistema

365
00:13:23,870 --> 00:13:26,430
