391
00:14:15,710 --> 00:14:17,470
Un tall per si es torna boic.

392
00:14:17,470 --> 00:14:17,890
Clar.

393
00:14:18,530 --> 00:14:20,210
Si el model demana eines, no sé,

394
00:14:20,410 --> 00:14:21,490
