408
00:14:47,570 --> 00:14:48,550
El teu programa peta.

409
00:14:49,350 --> 00:14:49,870
Immediatament.

410
00:14:50,270 --> 00:14:50,550
Peta.

411
00:14:50,990 --> 00:14:52,650
Clar, perquè no entén el text humà.

412
00:14:52,950 --> 00:14:53,490
Espera codi.

413
00:14:54,150 --> 00:14:54,950
Com ho evitem, això?

414
00:14:55,550 --> 00:14:56,490
Aquí és un entrant

415
00:14:56,510 --> 00:14:58,270
