416
00:14:58,430 --> 00:14:59,890
o Structured Outputs.

417
00:15:00,370 --> 00:15:01,330
Pots configurar l'API

418
00:15:01,330 --> 00:15:03,190
exigint un esquema JSON concret.

419
00:15:03,590 --> 00:15:05,310
I el que fa l'API per sota és brutal,

420
00:15:05,670 --> 00:15:07,170
